The '''Tombs of Amascut''' is a [[raid]] set in the [[Kharidian Desert]], within the [[Jaltevas Pyramid]] at the [[necropolis]]. To participate in the raid, players will have to complete the [[Beneath Cursed Sands]] [[quest]].

Despite the name of the raid, the tomb is in actuality that of the Pharaoh [[Osmumten]], where players must help him drive [[Amascut]] away from his tomb by freeing the lesser gods of the [[Menaphite Pantheon]] from her control and stopping her from acquiring the divine weapons found within that would allow her to ascend to [[god]]hood. 

Up to eight players may attempt the raid.

[[Ironman_Mode|Ironmen]] are eligible for rewards from the raid when completing it alongside other players. [[Group Ironman Mode|Group ironman players]] will lose their [[Group Ironman Mode#Prestige|prestige]] upon entering the raid with a player outside of their group.
==Transportation==
The quickest methods of reaching the necropolis are as follows:
* Teleporting to Jaltevas via the [[Pharaoh's sceptre]]. This method requires having used the sceptre on the [[Obelisk (Necropolis)|obelisk]] north of the necropolis mine.
* Teleporting via [[fairy ring]] code {{fairycode|AKP}}. This method requires level 62 [[Agility]].

Slower methods:
* Using the [[magic carpet]] from Shantay Pass to Pollnivneach, another carpet from the south side of Pollnivneach to Sophanem, and then walk south-east. This costs 400 coins without completion of the [[Rogue Trader]] miniquest, 200 coins after Rogue Trader, or free after completion of the [[Desert Hard Diary]].
** You can use the [[Construction cape]] or [[Pollnivneach teleport]] to teleport to [[Pollnivneach]] and then run south to the carpet to Sophanem.
* Teleport to Nardah and run south-west.

