===Raid Summary===
[[File:Tombs of Amascut - Raid Summary interface.png|thumb|350px|The Raid Summary interface, where the raid party can review their performance. The gold star denotes the Most Valuable Player (MVP).]]
At the end of the raid, players can review their performance in the raid by reading the scoreboard on the eastern side of the burial chamber, where they can view a summary of the raid, including details such as total damage dealt and received, number of deaths, and an honorary title.

