==Trivia==
* On release, a competition was held for the first teams to complete a Normal Mode and Expert Mode raid, with winners receiving 12 months of [[membership]]. The winners were announced on 16 September 2022:{{CiteNews|newsdate=16 September 2022|url=https://secure.runescape.com/m=news/tombs-of-amascut-balancing--bugfixes?oldschool=1|title=Tombs of Amascut: Balancing & Bugfixes}}
:{| class="wikitable" style="text-align:center;"
|-
!Mode
!Winner(s)
|-
|Normal Mode
|''Rovint'', ''Oblv Yuumi'', ''Oblv Poenari'', ''54N Kappa'', ''Animeme'', ''Hardesnikkel'', ''Kanao''
|-
|Expert Mode
|''Oblv Jraze''
|}
* The Tombs of Amascut is the only raid that:
** Has a different purple indicator, with Osmumten's sarcophagi glowing purple instead of the chest, which is instead opened for that player.
** Has their boss pet have reskin(s) that does not require the raid to be completed in a set amount of time.
** Does not provide extra bonuses for completing a raid on time.
* The Jungle Japes invocation is likely a reference to the first level of {{wp|Donkey Kong 64}} by the same name.

